WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:04.740
I'm Suchitra Sebastian and this is going to
be my new magnet lab at the University of

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:11.140
Cambridge. What my research is about is looking
at complicated materials under very extreme

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:17.880
conditions with the aim of creating new quantum
effects that emerge from trillions of electrons.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:22.939
So I put on very high magnetic fields, high
pressures and very low temperatures to bring

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:28.609
the material into this special quantum state.
So this lab is something I've specially designed

00:00:28.609 --> 00:00:33.460
— I've been designing it for quite a while
now — to provide specific conditions such

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:40.120
that a very high field magnet reaching 21
tesla and going down to very, very low temperatures,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:49.969
less 10 millikelvin, which is less than -272
degree Celsius. This very special high field

00:00:49.969 --> 00:00:56.059
magnet and low temperature refrigerator we're
going to put crystals of these special materials

00:00:56.059 --> 00:01:03.749
into this magnet which should be installed
within the next few months and create just

00:01:03.749 --> 00:01:09.400
these conditions that you only find in very
few places in the world such that we can create

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:15.479
amazing physics which revolutionizes our understanding
of materials beyond anything we know already.

